 "rule_a1": "Anchor rule (updated 2 Nov 2026): SELL = anchor 1 is the previous day's last HH pivot (a lower low or lower high after it that day is fine; a higher low after it that day rejects the anchor); anchor 2 = a complete candle today entirely above anchor 1 (high and low above it) - required first; entry = the first candle close below anchor 1 after that candle (a break alone is not enough); a higher low today does not invalidate. BUY mirror: anchor 1 = previous day's last LL (a lower high after it that day rejects); anchor 2 = a complete candle today entirely below anchor 1; entry = first close above anchor 1. Stop = prior candle high/low; target 1:2; same candle stop+target = stop; entry window 09:30-14:00 IST, NSE force close 15:00 IST. Filter = stop >= 1% of entry; No Filter is default."
